{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24094","headline":"旱热二首 一 · 白居易","name":"旱热二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"彤云散不雨，赫日吁可畏。\n端坐犹挥汗，出门岂容易。\n忽思公府内，青衫折腰吏。\n复想驿路中，红尘走马使。\n征夫更辛苦，逐客弥顦顇。\n日入尚趋程，宵分不遑寐。\n安知北窗叟，偃卧风飒至。\n簟拂碧龙鳞，扇摇白鹤翅。\n岂唯身所得，兼示心无事。\n谁言苦热天，元有清凉地。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24094.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24094","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}